   457                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------
   458                                  ; drawletter - draws one big 5x5 letter. Every pixel is a full
   459                                  ; block 2 cells wide, so a letter covers 5 rows x 10 columns.
   460                                  ; Parameters: row, column, attribute, address of 5-byte shape
   461                                  ; Local: [bp-2] = pixel rows still to draw
   462                                  ; ------------------------------------------------------------
